
This file provides the step of how to use this site supplied code base.

Development Envionment
1. Windows 11 2025 Update (Version 25H2)
2. Visual Studio 2022
3. Obtain a "Device Token" from your node operator, this will self configure your devlopment envionment.

Steps
1. Download the supplied Fido Provider here https://github.com/Money-2021/VaultedObjects/blob/main/Fido.dll
2. Great new Visual Studio Net8.0 MSTest (Microsoft's built-in framework)
3. Down laod the UnitTest cases as provided
4. Adapt the supplied code to your local MSTest envionment. including configuration of your DeviceToken pathway.
5. Execute the supplied UnitTest cases to verify correct operation of the code funtionality.

Suggested Test flow
1. UseCase_coin_balance()
2. UseCase_coin_local_pay_to_sin()
3. UseCase_coin_balance() for each Sin to verify payment flow betwen payment parties.

Notes
1. Typically a professional developer should allocate around 30 minutes to dcomplete the fist test case.
2. Visual Studion should automaticlaly download or request the download of all required Net8.0 supporting libaries.

